      "sequence_position": 3,
      "problem": "Let $F=GH.$ What is the value of ${f}_{12}$, if\n\n$$\nG=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,H=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 5 \\\\ 6 & -2\\end{aligned}]?\n$$\n\n${f}_{12}=$ \n{{field-1}}",
      "worked_solution": "Multiplying the $1$st row in $G$ by the $2$nd column in $H$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{12} & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =3\\cdot 5+(-4)\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =15+8 \\\\  & =23.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
